  DisplayName: Mystic Seer
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: You delight crowds by reading minds, telling futures, and contacting
    spirits. Although much of your work is misdirection and showmanship, your cons
    have inadvertently awakened a genuine awareness of magic in your mind. This new
    sense is both thrilling and frightening, and you hope that you can hone it further
    in the Circus of Wayward Wonders. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to
    Intelligence or Wisdom , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in
    the Arcana skill and the Scam Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Arcane
    Sense] skill feat.
